{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "About" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After installation, finish active work and reload your client's OpenCode service. CueDex will not restart it. Configured means installed, not connected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After installation, finish active work and reload your client's OpenCode service. CueDex will not restart it. Configured means installed, not connected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安装后，请先等当前任务结束，再重载客户端实际使用的 OpenCode 服务。CueDex 不会替你重启。「已配置」仅代表已安装，不代表已连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After enabling integration, open Settings > Hooks in Codex. Find the Stop hook whose command contains cuedex-notify, then review and trust it. CueDex cannot confirm its trust status." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After enabling integration, open Settings > Hooks in Codex. Find the Stop hook whose command contains cuedex-notify, then review and trust it. CueDex cannot confirm its trust status."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "启用集成后，请打开 Codex 的「设置 > Hooks」，找到 Stop 事件下命令包含 cuedex-notify 的钩子，检查并信任。CueDex 无法确认其信任状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
